:: Fishing Moor Fox Arrive
<<effects>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 fox>><<saveNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "watching">>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness to 0>>

A <<beasttype>> trots out of the heather and stops a short distance away, watching you with bright, curious eyes.<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Feed
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<if $fishingHookedFish.size gte 80>>
	You toss the $fishingHookedFish.type down in front of the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> sniffs it, clamps down, and hauls it off across the moor.
<<else>>
	You toss the $fishingHookedFish.type to the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> catches it neatly and bolts off into the heather.
<</if>>
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Angry Feed
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
You shove the $fishingHookedFish.type toward the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> snatches it from your hands and bolts off across the moor without looking back.
<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>

:: Fishing Moor Fox Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<beastCombatInit>>
	<<set $NPCList[0].stance to "top">>
	<<set $enemytrust to -200>>
	<<set $enemyanger to 200>>
	<<hawkRescueSetup>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>

<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend or ($pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0)>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Fox Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	The <<beasttype>> pulls back from you, seeming confused. <<bHe>> shakes <<bhis>> head and disappears into the heather.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You stow the $fishingHookedFish.type safely away.
		<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $alarm is 1 and $rescue is 1>>
	Your cry for help is answered. A <<hawkScreechDesc>> pierces the air. <<hawkRescueApproachSentence>>
	<br><br>

	The <<beasttype>> pulls back at the noise and bolts into the heather.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You manage to hold on to the $fishingHookedFish.type.
		<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<npc "Great Hawk">><<person1>>
	<<tearful>> you search the sky. You spot <<if $syndromebird is 1>>your<<else>>a<</if>> <<beasttype>> descending towards you.
	<br><br>

	<<set $phase to 0>>
	<<if $syndromebird is 1>>
		<<link [[Next|Bird Rescue Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Bird Rescue No Syndrome]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<beastwound>>
	The <<beasttype>> yelps, backs away with <<bhis>> tail between <<bhis>> legs, then turns and bolts off into the heather.
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You stow the $fishingHookedFish.type safely away.
		<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
		<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you wonder if all that was worth it for a $fishingHookedFish.type.

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingMoorFoxPhase>>
	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $pain gte 100 and $willpowerpain is 0>>
	<<if $fishingMoorFoxPhase is 1>>
		You're too battered to continue fighting as the <<beasttype>> grabs your $fishingHookedFish.type and darts off into the heather.
	<</if>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>
	
	<<tearful>> you wonder if all that was worth it for a $fishingHookedFish.type.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Cat Eat Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
You glance at the fox, then open wide and drop the whole $fishingHookedFish.type in your mouth. <<fishingEatFishTfProgress>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

The <<beasttype>> stares at you, stunned. Then <<bhis>> expression darkens, <<bhis>> ears go flat, and <<bhe>> launches <<bhimself>> at you.
<br><br>

<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled>>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $fishingMoorFoxPhase to 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You scramble back and shoo <<bhim>> off before <<bhe>> can attack you further, <<bhis>> claws scratching you before you force <<bhim>> away.<<beastescape>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Keep Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty 1 1000>><</silently>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
	The <<beasttype>> lunges for your $fishingHookedFish.type as you unhook it, but you're able to wrench it out of reach just in time.
	<br><br>

	You stow the $fishingHookedFish.type away, and the <<beasttype>> scampers back, ears flat against <<bhis>> head.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness -= random(3, 4)>>
	<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<else>>
	As you unhook the $fishingHookedFish.type, the <<beasttype>> lunges and snatches it, scampering off into the heather.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Throw Back Fox
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
<<if $settings.bestialityEnabled and dangerEvent()>>
	As you toss the $fishingHookedFish.type back, the <<beasttype>>'s eyes follow it into the water. <<bHe>> snaps <<bhis>> gaze to you, ears flat. <<bHe>> snarls, then throws <<bhimself>> at you.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Fox Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $fishingMoorFoxPhase to 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $rng lt 30>>
	As you throw the $fishingHookedFish.type back into the water, the <<beasttype>> darts forward and snatches it from the shallows before bounding off into the moor.
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.phase to "finished">><<endevent>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> watches as you throw the $fishingHookedFish.type back into the water. <<bHis>> shoulders sag and <<bhe>> looks up at you sadly.
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Moor Fox [widget]
<<widget "fishingMoorFoxAmbient">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "moor_fishing_fox">>
	<<set _foxMoved to false>>
	<<if $rng gte 70 and $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lt 9 and !$daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.movedLastLoop>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness += 1>>
		<<set _foxMoved to true>>
	<</if>>
	<<cleareventpool>>
	<<if _foxMoved>>
		<<if $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 2>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> pads closer and settles down to watch you.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 5>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> creeps nearer, crouching low in the heather.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 7>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> slides closer, settling now only a few paces away.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> slinks to within arm's reach and presses low against the ground.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 2>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> watches you from the edge of the heather.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 5>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> crouches in the heather nearby, eyes on your float.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.closeness lte 7>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> sits a few paces away, completely absorbed in watching you.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<<else>>
			<<addinlineevent 1>>
				The <<beasttype>> lies beside you, motionless, staring intently at your line.
			<</addinlineevent>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<runeventpool>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingMoor.fox.movedLastLoop to _foxMoved>>
	<<endevent>>
<</widget>>
